# What a source distribution carries beyond the package itself.
#
# `tools/` is the part that matters: fetch_headers.sh and collect_licences.py
# are how a wheel is built, and an sdist that cannot reproduce the wheel build
# is an sdist nobody can check (#97). Windows has no wheel by decision, so the
# sdist is the supported route there and needs them.
include LICENSE
include README.md
include CONTRIBUTING.md
include SECURITY.md
include tools/fetch_headers.sh
include tools/collect_licences.py
recursive-include analytic_prophet *.cpp
